# Graveyard Trespasser (turn 3): its enters trigger exiles the Shock, a noncreature card, so nobody loses or gains life ("if a
# creature card was exiled this way"). Casting it with daybound makes it day (CR 702.145d); Bot2 casts nothing on turn 4, so it
# becomes night as turn 5 begins (CR 731.2) and the Trespasser is Graveyard Glutton, a 4/4. Its attack trigger exiles both
# Ornithopters, two creature cards: "for each creature card", so 2 life is lost and 2 gained, not 1 (CR 608.2c). Combat then
# deals 4 to Bot2 (20 - 2 - 4 = 14).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Shock
Shock
Graveyard Trespasser
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

